                                "sense_id": "1f793372-713c-3b4d-8c45-6a3de066edd2",
                                "text": "On January 7, 1964, a group of American students at Balboa High School in the Panama Canal Zone set into motion events that soon threatened our relations with Panama and endangered operation of the Panama Canal. It was, on the surface, an inoffensive act: The students raised the American flag in front of the school."
                            }
